OL,3,GNEWSAFort Regent revamp could seek
OL,4,Aprivate investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrivate investment could be sought to
OL,7,Ffund redeveloping of Jersey's Fort
OL,8,FRegent, the infrastructure minister has
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FDeputy Jonathan Renouf laid out the
OL,12,Fnext steps for the project following a
OL,13,Frevelation that its #110m cost
OL,14,Fprojection from two years ago was
OL,15,Fexpected to rise due to inflationary
OL,16,Fpressures, design changes and the
OL,17,FMiddle East conflict.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
