OL,3,GNEWSAFort Regent revamp could seek
OL,4,Aprivate investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government's revamp of the St
OL,7,FHelier site is expected to include a
OL,8,F2,500-seat theatre, a 12-lane bowling
OL,9,Falley, a six-screen cinema, and places
OL,10,Fto eat and drink. It had been forecast
OL,11,Ffor completion by 2029.
OL,13,FBut Renouf said the work on the Grade I
OL,14,Flisted building had to be considered
OL,15,F"alongside the many other demands on
OL,16,Fpublic finances".
